<title>SPAIN: FORECAST-Santander Q1 attributable up 21pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Santander Q1 attributable up 21pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are financial analysts' on-average forecasts for Spanish Banco Santander SA's first-quarter earnings, which are due for release on April 29 (in billions of pesetas).</p>
<p>				  Q1 1997     Q1 1996	Range</p>
<p>    Net interest income    110.66	95.38    105.67-115.45</p>
<p>    Operating income	  53.50	41.31     50.30-59.50</p>
<p>    Attributable profit     24.27	20.05     23.31-24.73</p>
<p>Contributors are:  Ahorro Corporacion, Ibersecurities, Benito y Monjardin, Merrill Lynch and Inverban.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2159</p>
